# Matched-Horizon ORB Test — ATM baseline vs Sweep-Reclaim ORB (real intraday option bars)

THE last fair ORB test: an intraday-structure entry deserves a SHORT exit, not a 10-day swing. REAL Alpaca 5-min OPTION bars (2024+). Baseline enters the ATM call at 09:45 ET; Sweep-Reclaim at the engulf-candle close on pattern days. Same liquid names, ATM δ0.45-0.65, spread≤10%, ASK in / BID out (½ real spread) + $0.65/side. Exit = close at the horizon.

